  "description": {
   "en": "Princess Shushu has an overwhelming love for her people. In the country of Fuu where she is to be the ruler, tradition requires that the country be only ruled by a married couple, but because of this, Shu Shu has never been able to find a husband! Shushu sets off on a journey to find a husband in another country, but will she be able to get the husband she desires at the end of it?",
   "ja": "国民が大好きすぎる公主・シュシュ。彼女が国王となる鶴国は夫婦で国を治める決まりだが、そのせいで夫が一向に決まらない！　他国へ夫探しの旅に出たシュシュは、果たして旅先で望む夫は手に入るのか！？"
